<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-PANTANI WINS 15TH STAGE OF TOUR DE FRANCE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-PANTANI WINS 15TH STAGE OF TOUR DE FRANCE.</headline>
<dateline>MORZINE, France 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marco Pantani of Italy won the 15th stage of the Tour de France over 208.5 kms from Courchevel on Monday.</p>
<p>Jan Ullrich of Germany retained the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
